/// Converts to U8, rounding toward zero.
/// :returns: The integer part of `self`.
/// :throws: Crashes with `IntegerOverflowError` when `self` is NaN or its integer part lies outside [0, 255]. The crash reports the caller's location.
/// :see: {BF16.to_checked<U8>} to get an absent value instead, {BF16.to_clamp<U8>} to saturate.
